{"id":"00317","root":"uni00317_1","name":{"ja":"篠原　まり","en":"Shinohara Mari"},"title":{"ja":"【制服委員長】","en":"【Uniform Committee Chair】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【制服委員長】 篠原　まり","en":"【Uniform Committee Chair】 Shinohara Mari"},"element":"Natural","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-03-31","limited":true,"characterId":43,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園に通っている学生対魔忍。ふうまとは別のクラスで委員長をしている。対魔忍の中でもバカ力の持ち主で、自身の拳と土遁の術を掛け合わせた戦闘スタイルを得意としている。持って生まれた力をさらに発揮する為の専用武器の試作品を装備しており、これには一巻に一つの技が封じられた巻物弾が装填できる。これにより、土遁以外の術を使った技も使うことが可能になった。明るく笑顔が似合うが少しドジでおっちょこちょいな性格で、ずば抜けた身体能力を持っているにも関わらず、たまにドジをしてしまうことがある。","en":"Shinohara Mari is a student Taimanin attending Gosha Academy. She serves as class president in a different class from Fuuma. Among Taimanin, she possesses extraordinary brute strength and favors a combat style that blends her fists with earth-style ninjutsu. She equips a prototype exclusive weapon designed to unleash her innate power, which can be loaded with scroll-bullets, each sealed with a single technique. This allows her to use abilities beyond earth-style ninjutsu as well. Though bright and always smiling, she's a bit clumsy and scatterbrained, and despite her outstanding physical abilities, she sometimes trips herself up."},"illustrator":"ぽ～しょん","voiceActor":"藤井ねここ","forms":[{"id":"uni00317_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[782,1564],"sp":[130,130],"atk":[123,246],"def":[94,188],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","530009"]},{"id":"uni00317_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1164,2328],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[196,392],"def":[138,276],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","530009","530010"]},{"id":"uni00317_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1546,3099],"sp":[260,260],"atk":[269,539],"def":[182,364],"spd":[55,55],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","530009","530010"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Natural damage"}]},"530009":{"slot":"skill1","id":530009,"name":{"ja":"サボりはダメです！"},"hits":5,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":130,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":130,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":130,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":130,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":130,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 540% Natural damage"},{"text":"Self: take 30% of max HP as damage"}]},"530010":{"slot":"skill2","id":530010,"name":{"ja":"補習を受けてもらいます！"},"hits":3,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、超高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":2,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、超高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":3,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、超高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":4,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、超高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":5,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に中威力で攻撃、超高確率で麻痺状態にする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 289% Natural damage"},{"text":"1 enemy: 80% chance to inflict Paralysis for 2 turns","icon":"paralysis"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"制服委員長"},"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ユニットのSPをターン終了時に小回復する"},"effects":[{"text":"Natural allies: restore 10 SP at end of turn","icon":"Healing_sp"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":2,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00001",160],[1,"blo00004",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",10],[11,"blo00014",10],[12,"blo00001",320],[12,"blo00004",2],[13,"blo00007",10],[13,"blo00008",10],[14,"blo00010",10],[14,"blo00011",10],[15,"blo00013",10],[15,"blo00014",10],[16,"blo00007",10],[16,"blo00008",10],[17,"blo00010",10],[17,"blo00011",10],[18,"blo00013",10],[18,"blo00014",10],[19,"blo00007",10],[19,"blo00008",10],[20,"blo00010",5],[20,"blo00011",15],[20,"blo00012",5],[21,"blo00007",5],[21,"blo00008",15],[21,"blo00009",5],[22,"blo00013",5],[22,"blo00014",15],[22,"blo00015",5],[23,"blo00010",5],[23,"blo00011",15],[23,"blo00012",5],[24,"blo00007",5],[24,"blo00008",15],[24,"blo00009",5],[25,"blo00013",5],[25,"blo00014",15],[25,"blo00015",5],[26,"blo00001",320],[26,"blo00004",1],[27,"blo00007",5],[27,"blo00010",5],[27,"blo00013",5],[28,"blo00007",5],[28,"blo00010",5],[28,"blo00013",5],[29,"blo00007",5],[29,"blo00010",5],[29,"blo00013",5],[30,"blo00007",5],[30,"blo00010",5],[30,"blo00013",5],[31,"blo00001",320],[31,"blo00004",2],[32,"blo00007",5],[32,"blo00010",5],[32,"blo00013",5],[33,"blo00007",5],[33,"blo00010",5],[33,"blo00013",5],[34,"blo00007",5],[34,"blo00010",5],[34,"blo00013",5],[35,"blo00007",5],[35,"blo00010",5],[35,"blo00013",5],[36,"blo00001",320],[36,"blo00004",2],[37,"blo00007",5],[37,"blo00010",5],[37,"blo00013",5],[38,"blo00007",5],[38,"blo00010",5],[38,"blo00013",5],[39,"blo00007",5],[39,"blo00010",5],[39,"blo00013",5],[40,"blo00007",5],[40,"blo00010",5],[40,"blo00013",5],[41,"blo00001",640],[41,"blo00004",2],[42,"blo00007",5],[42,"blo00010",5],[42,"blo00013",5],[43,"blo00007",5],[43,"blo00010",5],[43,"blo00013",5],[44,"blo00007",5],[44,"blo00010",5],[44,"blo00013",5],[45,"blo00007",5],[45,"blo00010",5],[45,"blo00013",5],[46,"blo00001",640],[46,"blo00004",2],[47,"blo00007",5],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00010",5],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00013",5],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00007",5],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00010",5],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00013",5],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00007",5],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00010",5],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00013",5],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00007",5],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00010",5],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00013",5],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"お待たせしました、篠原まりです……え、制服姿は新鮮、ですか？　確かに……同じ学校なんですから、任務のとき以外も会いたいですね","en":"Sorry to keep you waiting, I'm Shinohara Mari… Huh, my uniform looks fresh to you? Well, since we're at the same school, it'd be nice to meet up even when we're not on a mission."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"たいちょ――う、じゃあなかったですね、すいません……学校だと、名前のほうがいいですよね","en":"Taicho—no, that's not it, sorry… At school, using my name is better, right?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"クラスが違うから、こうして話す機会も少ないんですよね、私たち。来年になれば、クラスは変わるんでしょうか","en":"Since we're in different classes, we don't get many chances to talk like this, do we? I wonder if our classes will change next year."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"あ、すいません、いま仕事中で……いえ、任務じゃなくて、クラスのです。これでも委員長ですから","en":"Ah, sorry, I'm in the middle of work right now… No, not a mission, just class duties. Even so, I'm the class president."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"ありがとうございます。委員長の仕事を手伝ってもらえるなんて、思いませんでした……ふふっ、今日は私が隊長ですね","en":"Thank you. I never expected anyone to help with the class president's duties… Hehe, looks like I'm the captain today."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"はぁ、終わった――さ、一緒に帰りましょう？　普段はしないんですけど、今日くらいは少し、寄り道しましょうか","en":"Phew, it's over—so, shall we go home together? I don't usually do this, but maybe we can take a little detour today."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"委員長の仕事ですか？　ＨＲの仕切りとか、提出物の回収とか、あとは――サボってるクラスメートの取り締まり、ですかね","en":"Class president duties? Like organizing homeroom, collecting assignments, and—maybe cracking down on slacking classmates."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"たまには買い食いもいいですね……稲毛屋、また一緒に来ましょう、ね？","en":"A snack break every now and then is nice… Inage-ya again together, okay?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00317_1/uni00317_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[50],"scenes":[["chr_0212_r18"]],"stills":[["chr_0212a_r18"]],"obtain":[{"kind":"gacha","type":"Limited","title":{"ja":"【復刻】新生活応援限定ガチャ"},"start":"2026-04-22","end":"2026-05-06"},{"kind":"spark","title":null,"need":30,"start":null,"end":null}],"standardPool":false,"art":{"graphicId":"uni_00317","graphicNum":2,"r18GraphicId":"uni_00317_r18","r18GraphicNum":2,"spineId":"Chr_0212"}}